 terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{4}{1+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\sqrt{2}x)^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386593 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386594 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386595 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386596 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386597 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1041 "selection" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386593 13194139536160 true] [17592186386592 1110 #uuid "ffb5dfc8-bb57-53c4-a17e-c885d65c750f" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386593 1034 "2\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386593 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386593 1111 #uuid "a461745c-9638-59d6-b368-b38c74fd7f43" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386594 1034 "4\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386594 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386594 1111 #uuid "26a88651-da37-5bd5-8a7f-6468439454b2" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386595 1034 "\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386595 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386595 1111 #uuid "8a5abfc8-8a22-5b8d-8d5b-c57656508aff" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386596 1034 "2\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2x)+C" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386596 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386596 1111 #uuid "cb4b52ef-dbc9-5fde-babe-9d7af5ad8ef2" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386597 1034 "2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386597 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386597 1111 #uuid "b280bf1a-b822-5709-93fe-2bfb49990147" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386598 1017 #edb/ref 17592186386599 13194139536160 true] [17592186386598 1089 "q-114078" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386598 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536160 true] [17592186386598 1100 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386598 1113 #uuid "a32b8631-d1be-5b85-884d-c14bcb1ed1c9" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386598 1145 "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/8)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/8}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/\\sqrt{8})^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{8}})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{8}}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\sqrt{8}\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nBefore substituting, we use the table below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can now write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/\\sqrt{8})^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot (\\sqrt{8}\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}/2}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u{|}_{0}^{\\sqrt{2}/2} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(0) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386600 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386601 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386602 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386603 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386604 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1041 "selection" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386603 13194139536160 true] [17592186386599 1110 #uuid "7a0ea3a4-63e3-5c65-acb6-1b0c3655603f" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386600 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{8}" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386600 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386600 1111 #uuid "b47a60c2-2da3-580d-976e-b576c2f65795" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386601 1034 "8\\pi " 13194139536160 true] [17592186386601 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386601 1111 #uuid "62b7abb7-da23-591f-97f8-57d989abd28e" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386602 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386602 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386602 1111 #uuid "9f1df431-339e-5d08-b70a-6a4b0efbc5d0" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386603 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{4}" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386603 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386603 1111 #uuid "7e44bb33-fe19-5182-b21a-6f3f76609df7" 13194139536160 true] [17592186386604 1034 "2\\pi " 13194139536160 true] [17592186386604 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536160 true] [17592186386604 1111 #uuid "8736ece3-310d-5c9d-bb4b-d50af6dbf9b5" 13194139536160 true] [1759218638